{
  "description": "Generate multiple molecule structure drawings at once.\n\nWrites image files (PNG and/or SVG, default both) per molecule — no\nChemDraw required. Failed names are skipped and reported in `failed`.\n\nUse this when the user wants several individual structures generated\nin one step (e.g. 'Draw Aspirin, Paracetamol and Ibuprofen').\n\nNot this tool for: ONE molecule — that is generate_molecule. Also not\nfor products of one reaction with yields (generate_scope_table) or for\ncontrasting structures (compare_molecules).\n\nIMPORTANT: Always pass English or IUPAC compound names, never localized\nnames. For example use 'Aspirin' not 'Acetylsalicylsäure', 'Caffeine'\nnot 'Coffein', 'Ascorbic acid' not 'Ascorbinsäure'. SMILES strings are\nalways safe.\n\nArgs:\n    molecules: List of English/IUPAC compound names or SMILES strings.\n    formats: Output file formats, any of \"png\", \"svg\", \"cdxml\"\n        (default: [\"png\", \"svg\"]). Include \"cdxml\" ONLY when the user\n        wants to edit the structures in ChemDraw.\n    abbreviate_groups: Set True to draw common substituents as short labels\n        (Ph, Bn, OAc, OMe, CO2H, tBu, Boc, Ts …) instead of full skeletons.\n        Applies to every molecule in the batch, so a series of structures\n        stays visually consistent.\n    render_style: Named look applied to every molecule in the batch. Empty\n        = standard style. \"compact\" for small printed figures,\n        \"presentation\" for slides, \"grayscale\" for grayscale printing.\n",
  "inputSchema": {
    "properties": {
      "abbreviate_groups": {
        "default": false,
        "title": "Abbreviate Groups",
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "annotate_stereo": {
        "default": false,
        "title": "Annotate Stereo",
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "formats": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "array"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null,
        "title": "Formats"
      },
      "molecules": {
        "items": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "title": "Molecules",
        "type": "array"
      },
      "render_style": {
        "default": "",
        "title": "Render Style",
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "molecules"
    ],
    "title": "batch_generateArguments",
    "type": "object"
  },
  "name": "batch_generate",
  "outputSchema": {
